      "content": "i guess. it's just hard to find meaning in anything anymore. everything feels so temporary and pointless. it's like i'm just waiting for something to happen, but nothing ever does. i keep thinking about how much easier it would be if i just stopped trying to struggle against it all. if i just... stopped.",
